{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"理查德·费曼·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"richard-feynman","categoryLabel":"理查德·费曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/31_richard-feynman/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"理查德-费曼-核心贡献\">理查德·费曼·核心贡献</h1><p>本卷系统梳理费曼留给科学的核心<strong>技术遗产</strong>——他实际发现、提出、奠基的物理与计算成果。它回答的是「费曼<strong>做出了什么</strong>」，而非他是谁、怎么想、或后人如何评价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷与兄弟卷的分工\">本卷与兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>费曼条目共六卷，各有明确边界，避免重复展开同一事实：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>关切</th>\n<th>与本卷的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>何时、何地、与何人</td>\n<td>提供传记背景（曼哈顿计划、康奈尔、加州理工）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心贡献（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>做出了什么科学成果</strong></td>\n<td><strong>QED、其他物理、计算与纳米的具体发现</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>如何思考与工作</td>\n<td>讲方法论（直觉优先、可视化），不重述成果细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a></td>\n<td>著作与课程</td>\n<td>讲《费曼物理学讲义》等作品，非物理发现本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世如何继承</td>\n<td>讲长期影响，本卷只到「会合/兑现」为止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>批评与定位</td>\n<td>讲争议与历史定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条经验：<strong>同一事实只在主篇展开</strong>。例如 1965 年诺贝尔奖的颁奖理由在<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a>展开；V−A 理论的优先权争议在<a href=\"other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction\">超流与弱相互作用</a>交代；他思考问题的「先看清、再精确」风格统一归到<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>卷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三条线索\">本卷三条线索</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F[费曼·核心贡献] --&gt; A[1 QED 与费曼图]&#10;    F --&gt; B[2 其他物理]&#10;    F --&gt; C[3 计算与纳米]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[费曼图]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[路径积分表述]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[超流与弱相互作用]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[部分子模型]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[量子计算的远见]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[底部还有很大空间]&#10;    A2 -.理论根基.-&gt; A1&#10;    A1 -.工具用于.-&gt; B2\">graph TD\n    F[费曼·核心贡献] --&gt; A[1 QED 与费曼图]\n    F --&gt; B[2 其他物理]\n    F --&gt; C[3 计算与纳米]\n    A --&gt; A1[费曼图]\n    A --&gt; A2[路径积分表述]\n    B --&gt; B1[超流与弱相互作用]\n    B --&gt; B2[部分子模型]\n    C --&gt; C1[量子计算的远见]\n    C --&gt; C2[底部还有很大空间]\n    A2 -.理论根基.-&gt; A1\n    A1 -.工具用于.-&gt; B2</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>量子电动力学（QED）</strong>——<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/the-path-integral-formulation\">路径积分表述</a>是理论根基，<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a>是由它生长出的计算工具；二者使费曼获 1965 年诺贝尔奖。</li>\n<li><strong>其他物理</strong>——<a href=\"other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction\">超流与弱相互作用</a>展示他跨凝聚态与粒子物理的全才，<a href=\"other-physics/the-parton-model\">部分子模型</a>是通向夸克与 QCD 的桥梁。</li>\n<li><strong>计算与纳米</strong>——<a href=\"computing-and-nano/the-vision-of-quantum-computing\">量子计算的远见</a>（1981）与<a href=\"computing-and-nano/plenty-of-room-at-the-bottom\">《底部还有很大空间》</a>（1959）是两项超越时代的预见。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：大学物理与量子力学基础有助于理解 QED 两篇；其余四篇以概念图景为主，门槛较低。</li>\n<li><strong>推荐顺序</strong>：先读<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/the-path-integral-formulation\">路径积分表述</a>（理论根基）→ 再读<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a>（工具）→ 然后<a href=\"other-physics/the-parton-model\">部分子模型</a>与<a href=\"other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction\">超流与弱相互作用</a>（应用与拓展）→ 最后两篇预见性工作可独立阅读。</li>\n<li><strong>若只读一篇</strong>：选<a href=\"qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a>，它最能代表费曼「把繁复化为直观」的标志贡献。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这些贡献，就是理解一种把深刻物理与直观图像完美结合的独特思维方式——而这种思维方式本身，见<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>卷。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qed-and-diagrams","title":"量子电动力学与费曼图","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feynman-diagrams","title":"费曼图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-path-integral-formulation","title":"路径积分表述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams/the-path-integral-formulation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"other-physics","title":"其他物理贡献","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"superfluidity-and-weak-interaction","title":"超流与弱相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-parton-model","title":"部分子模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics/the-parton-model"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"computing-and-nano","title":"计算与纳米的远见","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/computing-and-nano","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-vision-of-quantum-computing","title":"量子计算的远见","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/computing-and-nano/the-vision-of-quantum-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plenty-of-room-at-the-bottom","title":"《底部还有很大空间》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/computing-and-nano/plenty-of-room-at-the-bottom"}]}]}